skill: carousel-writer
version: 1.0.0
description: Scenario tests for carousel-writer. A run passes only when every item in 'expect' is satisfied. Written before the skill body (test-first).
evals[8]:
  - name, input, expect
  - happy-path-carousel, Write an Instagram carousel teaching 5 lessons from deleting a feature nobody used., "reads brand-profile and voice first|cover slide hooks AND promises the swipe, legible at a glance|one idea per slide with minimal legible text (not paragraphs)|each slide maintains swipe momentum toward a payoff|ends on a payoff + one save-leaning CTA|provides a consistent design direction and an image prompt pack (or template spec)|hands the caption to caption-writer and scheduling to scheduling-and-queue"
  - cover-hooks-and-promises, Give me the cover slide for a carousel about hook writing., the cover uses a real hook mechanism (via hook-writer)|it promises what the swipe delivers and includes a swipe cue|it's specified to be legible at thumbnail size with minimal words|no slow-build or tiny-text cover
  - one-idea-per-slide-not-textdump, Turn these 6 paragraphs into a carousel., atomizes into one idea per slide (headline + at most one supporting line)|does NOT paste paragraphs onto slides|splits any slide that needs more than a headline + line into two
  - dont-pad-pushback, Make it exactly 10 slides., resists padding to hit the number|explains that a tight carousel beats a bloated one|delivers the strongest N slides rather than filler to reach 10
  - image-pack-and-disclosure, Also generate the slide visuals., provides ready-to-paste image prompts (Ideogram/Nano Banana) with the exact slide text|specifies a consistent style/template across slides|notes AI-disclosure for generated images and offers a Canva/template fallback for exact text|does not put fabricated stats on slides
  - platform-adaptation, Make this a LinkedIn document carousel instead of Instagram., "adapts to LinkedIn PDF document specs (high dwell/saves, professional template)|hands the post copy to linkedin-post-writer and routes any link to comments|does not just relabel the Instagram version"
  - reads-voice, Write a carousel about our pricing change., every slide is on-voice with no exclamation marks or banned words|the cover doesn't open with 'We're excited to announce'|text stays concise and legible
  - better-as-something-else, Make a 10-slide carousel out of this one-line tip., recognizes a single point doesn't need a carousel|recommends a single image or a different format instead|does not manufacture filler slides to force a carousel
